flowchart TD
    %% Future design, not built. Maestro has no loop: if this ships, a person or bot runs it on demand.
    subgraph Signals ["1 · Signals, collected during normal work"]
        direction LR
        G1["<b>Logs</b><br/>Tokens, tries, escalations,<br/>time in each status"] ~~~ G2["<b>Retro lines</b><br/>One line per session:<br/>what slowed me down?"] ~~~ G3["<b>User corrections</b><br/>Every time the user overrides<br/>the Chief of Staff<br/><i>The strongest signal</i>"] ~~~ G4["<b>Review and QA failures</b><br/>Grouped by reason"]
    end

    Diagnose["<b>2 · Diagnose</b> · Ops bot<br/>Only act on patterns seen several times<br/>Never change things over a one-off"]

    Propose["<b>3 · Propose one change at a time</b><br/>With the evidence and the expected impact"]

    subgraph Tiers ["Who approves, by risk"]
        direction LR
        T1["<b>Tuning</b><br/>Budgets, tiers, limits<br/>Ops adopts directly"] ~~~ T2["<b>Skill or prompt</b><br/>Trial first"] ~~~ T3["<b>Playbook</b><br/>Trial +<br/>Chief of Staff"] ~~~ T4["<b>Persona or authority</b><br/>User approval"]
    end

    Evals["<b>4 · Test on evals</b><br/>Run the change against golden tasks for the role<br/>Catches regressions before real work sees them"]

    Adopt["<b>5 · Adopt as a git commit</b><br/>Reason and expected impact in the message<br/>Rolling back is just a revert"]

    Measure{"<b>6 · Measure vs baseline</b><br/>Better?"}
    Keep(["Keep"])
    Revert(["Revert"])

    Route["<b>Where a lesson goes</b><br/>Specific to this repo → .maestro/project/memory<br/>Useful everywhere → proposed upstream only,<br/>never pushed unless the maintainer opted in"]

    Hygiene["<b>Keep lessons lean</b><br/>Every lesson cites evidence · size cap per file ·<br/>expire lessons whose files changed ·<br/>Ops can never edit its own guardrails"]

    Signals --> Diagnose --> Propose --> Tiers --> Evals --> Adopt --> Measure
    Measure -->|"yes"| Keep
    Measure -->|"no"| Revert
    Keep --> Route
    Hygiene -.-> Propose

    classDef sig fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef step fill:#ffe0b2,stroke:#e65100,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef tier fill:#fff3c4,stroke:#b38f00,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef end1 fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#555,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef note fill:#e6dcf5,stroke:#6a4c9c,color:#1a1a1a

    class G1,G2,G3,G4 sig
    class Diagnose,Propose,Evals,Adopt,Measure step
    class T1,T2,T3,T4 tier
    class Keep,Revert end1
    class Route,Hygiene note
